{"passageId": "2004_06_3001194-q26", "examId": "2004_06_3001194", "year": 2004, "exam": "6월", "form": "", "board": "수능모의평가", "era": "foreign_old", "qNumbers": [26], "type": "빈칸추론", "answer": 3, "text": "Glittering gems called diamonds are among the most precious of human possessions. Through the ages, they have been a lasting evidence of wealth. Lands may lose their soil, buildings may be destroyed, stocks and bonds may become worthless, but the value of diamonds remains relatively unchanged. In addition, the diamond is the hardest substance ever known. Because of this, it is of great value for practical use. In fact, about three-fourths of the total annual supply of diamonds is used in factories and machine shops.", "wordCount": 85, "reconstructionKind": "blank", "reconstruction": {"kind": "blank", "blankFilledWith": "In addition", "order": null, "insertedAt": null, "insertedSentence": null, "removedSentence": null, "removedMarker": null, "correction": null, "suggestedCorrection": null, "hasDeliberateError": false}, "hasDeliberateError": false, "confidence": "low", "note": "연결어 빈칸. 정답키 비어 응집성 판단(③ In addition): 가치+경도 추가 진술"}
{"passageId": "2004_06_3001194-q28", "examId": "2004_06_3001194", "year": 2004, "exam": "6월", "form": "", "board": "수능모의평가", "era": "foreign_old", "qNumbers": [28], "type": "내용일치", "answer": null, "text": "John Williams is famous for his ability to write powerful and highly effective music for movies. Mr. Williams has been writing music for movies since 1960, but he is perhaps best known for his award-winning scores for movies such as Jaws, Star Wars, and Schindler's List. Before he began writing music for the movies, Mr. Williams dreamed of being a concert pianist. During the 1950s, Mr. Williams was into jazz and he worked in New York with many jazz artists. Later, he moved to Los Angeles and got a job writing music for television shows. It was this television job which led him into movies.", "wordCount": 105, "reconstructionKind": "none", "reconstruction": null, "hasDeliberateError": false, "confidence": "high", "note": "John Williams 인물 설명문 내용일치. 단순추출"}
